# Build context filter for apps/docs/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# apps/docs/fixtures stays in: the build's no-content check reads its markers. Nothing from it reaches the image.
**/node_modules
.git
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env*
**/*.log
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
tools/dev-hub
.dev
.age
deploy/identity
